## MilestoneAgent — Revised Milestones

Based on the ValidatorAgent's feedback, I agree with the recommendation to reduce `max_distance` from 16 to 6 for the "find iron_ore" milestone. The original value of 16 was too generous — the player could satisfy it from near spawn (~11.3 blocks away) just by looking in the right direction. Reducing to 6 ensures the player must actually walk toward the iron ore cluster to demonstrate they found it.

